      "reading_order": 931,
      "section": "General",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 63.609700000000004,
        "t": 492.6608,
        "r": 477.6694999999996,
        "b": 467.28380000000004
      },
      "content": "The compressor oil flow is controlled by two thermostatic valves (BV1 and BV2), ensuring reliable compressor operation and optimum energy recovery.",
